{"strongs": "H5715", "word": "עֵדוּת", "translit": "e.dut", "root": "עוג", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "testimony", "definition": "עֵדוּת 19 and עֵדֻת 27 noun feminine testimony ; — ׳ ע absolute Exod 16:34 +, construct Ps 19:8 +; plural suffix עֵדְוֺתֶיךָ Ps 119:14 +, עֵדְוֺתָיו Jer 44:23 + 4 t.; — 1. testimony of the Ten Words on the tables as a solemn divine charge, ׳ לֻחֹת הע Exod 31:18 ; Exod 32:15 ; Exod 34:29 ( P ), ׳ הע Exod 25:16 ; Exod 25:21 ; Exod 40:20 ( P ); ark as containing tables, ׳ אֲרוֺן הע Exod 25:22 ; Exod 26:33 ; Exod 26:34 ; Exod 30:6 ; Exod 30:26 ; Exod 39:35 ; Exod 40:3 ; Exod 40:5 ; Exod 40:21 ; Num 4:5 ; Num 7:89 (all P ), Josh 4:16 ( J E ; Kue הברית [against him Di ], so Benn Steuern ), ׳ הארן לע Exod 31:7 ( P ); abbreviated ׳ לִפְנֵי הע Exod 16:34 ; Exod 30:36 ; Num 17:19 ; Num 17:25 ( P ); ׳ עַל הע Exod 27:21 (= ׳ הע Lev 24:3 ), Lev 30:6 ; Lev 16:13 ( P ); tabernacle as containing ark of testimony, ׳ משׁכן הע tabernacle of the testimony Exod 38:21 ; Num 1:50 ; Num 1:53 (twice in verse); Num 10:11 ( P ); so ׳ אֹהֶל הע Num 9:15 ; Num 17:22 ; Num 17:23 ; Num 18:2 ( P ) 2Chr 24:6 . 2. the code of law in general (late), as a testimony of God: Ps 19:8 ; Ps 119:88 ; Ps 122:4 || תּוֺרָה Ps 78:5 || חֹק Ps 81:6 . In titles, עַלֿ ׳ שׁוּשַׁן ע Ps 60:1 , ׳ אֶלשֹֿׁשַׁנּ֑ים ע Ps 80:1 = melody whose first line compare law as testimony to a choice flower. Special laws of the code are denoted by plural; + חֻקּוֺת etc. 1Kgs 2:3 ; 2Kgs 23:3 = 2Chr 34:31 (+ חקים etc.), Jer 44:23 חֻקִּים etc. 1Chr 29:19 מִצְוֺת Neh 9:34 plural of contents of covenant 2Kgs 17:15 plural elsewhere Ps 119:14 ; Ps 119:31 ; Ps 119:36 ; Ps 119:99 ; Ps 119:111 ; Ps 119:129 ; Ps 119:144 ; Ps 119:157 . See also III. [ עֵדָה ]. — For הָעֵדוּת 2Kgs 11:12 = 2Chr 23:11 read probably הַצְּעָדוֺת (compare 2Sam 1:10 We and others).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5861')\">BDB5861</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5715')\">H5715</entry>]</h1><div class=\