euern</lookup>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הארן לע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 31:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,31,7)\">Exod 31:7</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); abbreviated <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לִפְנֵי הע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 16:34\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(2,16,34)\">Exod 16:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 30:36\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,36)\">Exod 30:36</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 17:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,19)\">Num 17:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 17:25\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,25)\">Num 17:25</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַל הע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 27:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,21)\">Exod 27:21</ref> (= <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 24:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,24,3)\">Lev 24:3</ref>), <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Lev 30:6\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(3,30,6)\">Lev 30:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 16:13\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,13)\">Lev 16:13</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); tabernacle as containing ark of testimony, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>משׁכן הע</bdbheb> <highlight>tabernacle of the testimony</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 38:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,21)\">Exod 38:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 1:50\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"50\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"50\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,50)\">Num 1:50</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 1:53\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"53\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"53\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,53)\">Num 1:53</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Num 10:11\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,11)\">Num 10:11</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); so <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֹהֶל הע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 9:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,9,15)\">Num 9:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 17:22\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,22)\">Num 17:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 17:23\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,23)\">Num 17:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 18:2\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,2)\">Num 18:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:6\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,6)\">2Chr 24:6</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> the code of law in general (late), as a <highlight>testimony</highlight> of God: <ref ref=\"Ps 19:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,19,8)\">Ps 19:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:88\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"88\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"88\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,88)\">Ps 119:88</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 122:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"122\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"122\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,122,4)\">Ps 122:4</ref> || <bdbheb>תּוֺרָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 78:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,5)\">Ps 78:5</ref> || <bdbheb>חֹק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 81:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"81\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"81\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,81,6)\">Ps 81:6</ref>. In titles, <bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁוּשַׁן ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 60:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,60,1)\">Ps 60:1</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֶלשֹֿׁשַׁנּ֑ים ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 80:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"80\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"80\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,80,1)\">Ps 80:1</ref> = melody whose first line compare law as testimony to a choice flower. Special laws of the code are denoted by plural; + <bdbheb>חֻקּוֺת</bdbheb> etc. <ref ref=\"1Kgs 2:3\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(11,2,3)\">1Kgs 2:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:3\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,3)\">2Kgs 23:3</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:31\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,31)\">2Chr 34:31</ref> (+ <bdbheb>חקים</bdbheb> etc.), <ref ref=\"Jer 44:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,44,23)\">Jer 44:23</ref> <bdbheb>חֻקִּים</bdbheb> etc. <ref ref=\"1Chr 29:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,29,19)\">1Chr 29:19</ref> <bdbheb>מִצְוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 9:34\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,34)\">Neh 9:34</ref> plural of contents of covenant <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:15\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,15)\">2Kgs 17:15</ref> plural elsewhere <ref ref=\"Ps 119:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,14)\">Ps 119:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:31\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,31)\">Ps 119:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:36\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,36)\">Ps 119:36</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:99\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"99\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"99\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,99)\">Ps 119:99</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:111\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"111\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"111\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,111)\">Ps 119:111</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:129\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"129\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"129\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,129)\">Ps 119:129</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:144\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"144\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"144\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,144)\">Ps 119:144</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:157\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"157\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"157\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,157)\">Ps 119:157</ref>. See also III. [<bdbheb>עֵדָה</bdbheb>]. — For <bdbheb>הָעֵדוּת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 11:12\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(12,11,12)\">2Kgs 11:12</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 23:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,23,11)\">2Chr 23:11</ref> read probably <bdbheb>הַצְּעָדוֺת</bdbheb> (compare <ref ref=\"2Sam 1:10\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(10,1,10)\">2Sam 1:10</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> and others). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Exod 16:34", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 16, "verse": 34}, {"raw": "Ps 19:8", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 19, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Ps 119:14", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 119, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Jer 44:23", "book": "JER", "chapter": 44, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Exod 31:18", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 31, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Exod 32:15", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 32, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Exod 34:29", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 34, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "Exod 25:16", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 25, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Exod 25:21", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 25, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Exod 40:20", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 40, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Exod 25:22", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 25, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Exod 26:33", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 26, "verse": 33}, {"raw": "Exod 26:34", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 26, "verse": 34}, {"raw": "Exod 30:6", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 30, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Exod 30:26", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 30, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "Exod 39:35", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 39, "verse": 35}, {"raw": "Exod 40:3